  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 2, ‘NHWA steps to strengthen HRH data monitoring and use’. At the top, three stacked orange rounded bars with downward pointers show the conceptualization steps in sequence: ‘1. Governmental “buy-in”’, ‘2. Governance’, and ‘3. Scoping and planning’. Below them, a circular green ring with clockwise arrows encloses a three-sector wheel of routine operationalization steps: ‘5. Data compilation and analysis’ at the top, ‘6. Validation’ at the bottom right, and ‘7. Dissemination’ at the bottom left. Spanning from Step 2 to the bottom of the wheel, a green curly brace on the left connects to ‘4. Legal framework’ (green box) and a blue curly brace on the right connects to ‘8. Process revision’ (blue box).",
